Package: spfigR
Title: Spatial Figures from Existing Results
Version: 0.2.2
Authors@R: person(given = "Jiang", family = "Congxin", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jcx981212@163.com")
Author: Jiang Congxin
Maintainer: Jiang Congxin <jcx981212@163.com>
Description: Draw annotated spatial maps and feature maps from exported results. Checks section-specific coordinates, spot-feature coverage and zoom regions, and exports figures with source data, methods and reproducible task reports.
